@startuml QuizSubmission
title Quiz Submission Sequence Diagram

actor Learner
boundary "Quiz UI" as UI
control "Quiz API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
control "Recommendation Engine" as REC

Learner -> UI: Open quiz
UI -> API: Request quiz questions
API -> DB: Load questions and answers
DB --> API: Return quiz data
API --> UI: Display quiz
Learner -> UI: Select answers and submit
UI -> API: Submit quiz attempt
API -> API: Calculate score and explanations
API -> DB: Store quiz attempt
API -> DB: Write activity log
API -> REC: Update mastery evidence
REC -> DB: Read latest quiz attempts\nand progress
REC --> API: Return updated signals
API --> UI: Return score, explanations,\nand next suggestions
UI --> Learner: Display quiz result

@enduml
